 460:   /// Executes a named command registered via [registry]. Lets plugins run
 461:   /// commands without a typed controller method. Throws
 462:   /// [UnknownCommandException] if [name] is not registered (use
 463:   /// [tryExecuteCommand] for a no-throw variant).
 464:   ChangeSet executeCommand(String name, Map<String, Object?> args) {
 465:     // Build the command via the registry, then route through [execute] so the
 466:     // command/selection/document callbacks fire from a single dispatch point.
 467:     return execute(registry.build(name, args));
 468:   }
